    summary: 'Tokenizer decode is the inverse of encode: it maps the sampled ids to characters. It runs after sampling every step so that text can be streamed, and must be incremental because many tokens are fragments of words or of multi-byte UTF-8 characters. It is unrelated to generation decoding, which chooses the ids.',
